<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - A.G. Edwards cuts Bellsouth.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - A.G. Edwards cuts Bellsouth.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- A.G. Edwards said Monday it had cut its rating on BellSouth Corp to maintain from accumulate due to price.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- BellSouth's stock dropped 1-1/4 to 42-3/4 in afternoon trading.</p>
</text>
